<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sw">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>GAVI JM Official</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background: #000;
      color: white;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 50px 20px;
    }
    .profile-pic {
      width: 180px;
      height: 180px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 4px solid #25F4EE;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px #25F4EE;
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #25F4EE;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #25F4EE;
      color: #000;
      padding: 14px 35px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px #25F4EE;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <img src="pic7.jpg" alt="Gavi JM" class="profile-pic">
  
  <h1>GAVI JM Official</h1>
  
  <p>
    Hello! My name is Gavi 👋<br>
    Karibu kwenye website yangu rasmi.<br>
    I create fun TikTok videos 🎬<br>
    Support yako inamaanisha mengi ❤️
  </p>
  
  <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@gavi773.ke" target="_blank" class="btn">
    FOLLOW ME ON TIKTOK
  </a>

  <p style="color:#aaa; font-size:14px; margin-top:40px;">
    @gavi773.ke
  </p>

</body>
</html>